  "about": "Scheduled automation while the Mac sleeps 8 h (23:00-07:00): due items arrive during the night and wait; at wake the scheduler lists what is due and runs each (the oldest first: consume 4.2 due items on average, write a trigger-dispatch-outcome for each). Measured: founder trigger-dispatch-outcome 234 writes/day [L] (x K = 4.2/day), due rows in workshop_current and 15,982 model_waits retried up to 8 times [A]; outcome 186 B [S o26], due item 1,925 B (founder trigger mean) [S o03]. Rate: plan A-TYP 'daily' with 4.2 due items per night. Sources: [A] 04-every-table-challenged.md; [P] clone queries on o08/o21/o27/o04/o07/o09 (profile-overhead lane, 2026-10-27); [L] clone queries o03 record_log 2026-10-20..22 PDT, o04 namespace_names, o21 account_control_permits operations (4 load days 2026-10-15..23); [S] --seed-from profile: founder o03 2,398,695 current records / 178 kinds, second account o26 24,263 records. Typical sizes come from the second account [S o26] where the kind exists there, else the founder [S o03]. ",
  "stores": 1,
  "owners": 4,
  "vocabulary": 2000,
